OL,3,GNEWSADucks recovering after dried-up
OL,4,Apond rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo ducks have died and three ducks are
OL,7,Fbeing looked after by a bird rescue
OL,8,Fcentre after being recovered from a
OL,9,Fdried-up pond.
OL,11,FMK Swan Rescue CIC was called to the
OL,12,Fpond near Little Brickhill, in
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire, on Saturday evening,
OL,14,Fby two walkers who had discovered five
OL,15,Fducks encased in the mud.
OL,17,FAlthough all birds were recovered alive
OL,18,Fat the scene, two have since died from
OL,19,Fcomplications sustained from being
OL,20,Ftrapped in the pond.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
