OL,3,GNEWSADucks recovering after dried-up
OL,4,Apond rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllie Humphries, the Founder and
OL,7,FDirector of MK Swan Rescue CIC, said
OL,8,Fwhen she found the ducks, they were
OL,9,F"caked in mud" and looked like they had
OL,10,Fbeen "turned to stone".
